    [4906]={name="Rainwalker Boots",quality=1,ilvl=7,reqLevel=3,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Rite of Vision'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Zarlman Two-Moons in Mulgore. Objective: Consume the Water of the Seers in front of the tribal fire in Bloodhoof Village and follow the vision once it appears. Provided item:.",zone="Mulgore",questName="Rite of Vision",lore="I now present you with the Water of the Seers. When you are ready, consume the waters near the tribal fire. Once you have ingested the holy waters, it will take a few moments before the vision materializes before the fire."},
    [4907]={name="Woodland Tunic",quality=1,ilvl=5,reqLevel=1,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Webwood Egg'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Gilshalan Windwalker in Teldrassil. Objective: Bring a Webwood Egg to Gilshalan in Aldrassil.",zone="Teldrassil",questName="Webwood Egg",lore="Now that I have the spiders' venom, I'd like some live specimens to study. Unfortunately, capturing a living, giant spider is more than I can ask of you, young."},
    [4908]={name="Nomadic Bracers",quality=1,ilvl=5,reqLevel=1,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Hunt Continues'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Grull Hawkwind in Mulgore. Objective: Grull Hawkwind in Camp Narache wants you to bring him 10 Mountain Cougar Pelts.",zone="Red Cloud Mesa",questName="The Hunt Continues",lore="A tauren skilled in the ways of the hunt knows that his prey is not for mere trophy. The beasts of the plains provide us with a means of survival."},
    [4909]={name="Kodo Hunter's Leggings",quality=2,ilvl=15,reqLevel=3,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Rites of the Earthmother'. Starts with Cairne Bloodhoof in Thunder Bluff. Objective: Cairne Bloodhoof in Thunder Bluff wants you to bring him the Horn of Arra'chea.",zone="Mulgore",questName="Rites of the Earthmother",lore="We are hunters. Down below in Mulgore there is a mighty kodo named Arra'chea."},
    [4910]={name="Painted Chain Gloves",quality=1,ilvl=5,reqLevel=1,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Hunt Begins'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Grull Hawkwind in Mulgore. Objective: Grull Hawkwind in Camp Narache wants you to bring him 7 Plainstrider Feathers and 7 pieces of Plainstrider Meat.",zone="Red Cloud Mesa",questName="The Hunt Begins",lore="You have a promising air about you, and will prove yourself to the tribe. Perhaps someday soon you will be welcomed into the great city of Thunder Bluff."},
    [4911]={name="Thick Bark Buckler",quality=1,ilvl=5,reqLevel=1,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Attack on Camp Narache'. The quest is in Mulgore. Objective: Bring the Bristleback Attack Plans to Chief Hawkwind in Camp Narache.",zone="Red Cloud Mesa",questName="Attack on Camp Narache",lore="After carefully evaluating the map, you realize that what you discovered are the plans made by the Bristleback warchief for an extended siege on Camp Narache."},
    [4913]={name="Painted Chain Belt",quality=1,ilvl=5,reqLevel=1,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Hunt Continues'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Grull Hawkwind in Mulgore. Objective: Grull Hawkwind in Camp Narache wants you to bring him 10 Mountain Cougar Pelts.",zone="Red Cloud Mesa",questName="The Hunt Continues",lore="A tauren skilled in the ways of the hunt knows that his prey is not for mere trophy. The beasts of the plains provide us with a means of survival."},
    [4914]={name="Battleworn Leather Gloves",quality=1,ilvl=5,reqLevel=1,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Cutting Teeth'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Gornek in Durotar. Objective: Kill 10 Mottled Boars then return to Gornek at the Den.",zone="Durotar",questName="Cutting Teeth",lore="The first order of business will be to put a little strength in your backbone. I could send you out to the Barrens to hunt kodo, but well, in all honesty, you're more useful to us alive than dead."},
    [4915]={name="Soft Wool Boots",quality=1,ilvl=5,reqLevel=1,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Cutting Teeth'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Gornek in Durotar. Objective: Kill 10 Mottled Boars then return to Gornek at the Den.",zone="Durotar",questName="Cutting Teeth",lore="The first order of business will be to put a little strength in your backbone. I could send you out to the Barrens to hunt kodo, but well, in all honesty, you're more useful to us alive than dead."},
    [4916]={name="Soft Wool Vest",quality=1,ilvl=5,reqLevel=1,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Sarkoth'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Hana'zua in Durotar. Objective: Kill Sarkoth and bring his claw back to Hana'zua.",zone="Durotar",questName="Sarkoth",lore="Seeing the deed you have done for me steels my heart. I cannot fall so easily! I must endure! But it remains that I cannot make the trek back to the Den unassisted."},
    [4917]={name="Battleworn Chain Leggings",quality=1,ilvl=5,reqLevel=1,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Sarkoth'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Hana'zua in Durotar. Objective: Kill Sarkoth and bring his claw back to Hana'zua.",zone="Durotar",questName="Sarkoth",lore="Seeing the deed you have done for me steels my heart. I cannot fall so easily! I must endure! But it remains that I cannot make the trek back to the Den unassisted."},
    [4919]={name="Soft Wool Belt",quality=1,ilvl=5,reqLevel=1,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Sting of the Scorpid'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Gornek in Durotar. Objective: Get 10 Scorpid Worker Tails for Gornek in the Den.",zone="Durotar",questName="Sting of the Scorpid",lore="Powerful warrior and awkward novice alike have fallen to the venomous sting of the scorpid. You will find large numbers of scorpids northwest of here."},
    [4920]={name="Battleworn Cape",quality=1,ilvl=5,reqLevel=1,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Sting of the Scorpid'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Gornek in Durotar. Objective: Get 10 Scorpid Worker Tails for Gornek in the Den.",zone="Durotar",questName="Sting of the Scorpid",lore="Powerful warrior and awkward novice alike have fallen to the venomous sting of the scorpid. You will find large numbers of scorpids northwest of here."},
    [4921]={name="Dust-covered Leggings",quality=1,ilvl=5,reqLevel=1,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Burning Blade Medallion'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Zureetha Fargaze in Durotar. Objective: Bring the Burning Blade Medallion to Zureetha Fargaze, outside The Den.",zone="Durotar",questName="Burning Blade Medallion",lore="Through my divinations, I see that an item of power hides deep within the Burning Blade Coven, guarded by beasts and black magic. It is called the Burning Blade Medallion, and your next task is to find it and remove it from the coven."},
    [4922]={name="Jagged Chain Vest",quality=1,ilvl=5,reqLevel=1,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Burning Blade Medallion'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Zureetha Fargaze in Durotar. Objective: Bring the Burning Blade Medallion to Zureetha Fargaze, outside The Den.",zone="Durotar",questName="Burning Blade Medallion",lore="Through my divinations, I see that an item of power hides deep within the Burning Blade Coven, guarded by beasts and black magic. It is called the Burning Blade Medallion, and your next task is to find it and remove it from the coven."},
    [4928]={name="Sandrunner Wristguards",quality=1,ilvl=8,reqLevel=3,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'From The Wreckage....'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Gar'Thok in Durotar. Objective: Gar'Thok of Razor Hill wants you to retrieve 3 Gnomish Tools from the wreckage off the coast.",zone="Durotar",questName="From The Wreckage....",lore="One of my most observant scouts brings back word that the wreckage of Proudmoore's fleet still remains off the coast of Durotar, just east of Tiragarde Keep."},
    [4933]={name="Seasoned Fighter's Cloak",quality=1,ilvl=9,reqLevel=5,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Thwarting Kolkar Aggression'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Lar Prowltusk in Durotar. Objective: Lar Prowltusk outside of Sen'jin Village wants you to destroy the 3 sets of Attack Plans held within Kolkar Crag.",zone="Durotar",questName="Thwarting Kolkar Aggression",lore="Lower your voice. The Kolkar centaurs lie just over the ridge to the west in Kolkar Crag."},
    [4935]={name="Wide Metal Girdle",quality=1,ilvl=8,reqLevel=3,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'From The Wreckage....'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Gar'Thok in Durotar. Objective: Gar'Thok of Razor Hill wants you to retrieve 3 Gnomish Tools from the wreckage off the coast.",zone="Durotar",questName="From The Wreckage....",lore="One of my most observant scouts brings back word that the wreckage of Proudmoore's fleet still remains off the coast of Durotar, just east of Tiragarde Keep."},
    [4936]={name="Dirt-trodden Boots",quality=1,ilvl=8,reqLevel=3,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'From The Wreckage....'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Gar'Thok in Durotar. Objective: Gar'Thok of Razor Hill wants you to retrieve 3 Gnomish Tools from the wreckage off the coast.",zone="Durotar",questName="From The Wreckage....",lore="One of my most observant scouts brings back word that the wreckage of Proudmoore's fleet still remains off the coast of Durotar, just east of Tiragarde Keep."},
    [4937]={name="Charging Buckler",quality=1,ilvl=9,reqLevel=7,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Need for a Cure'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Rhinag in Durotar. Objective: Find Kor'ghan in Orgrimmar and get the Venomtail Antidote. Then bring the antidote to Rhinag near the northwestern border of Durotar.",zone="Durotar",questName="Need for a Cure",lore="... your timing is perfect. I just hope I can compliment your haste as well. I was careless while fighting a few of the venomtails nearby, and one of them stung me deeply."},
    [4939]={name="Steady Bastard Sword",quality=2,ilvl=11,reqLevel=4,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Skull Rock'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Margoz in Durotar. Objective: Gather Searing Collars from the cultists in Skull Rock.Bring them to Margoz at his camp.",zone="Durotar",questName="Skull Rock",lore=". The Burning Blade has infested the cave east of Orgrimmar known as Skull Rock. Inside that cave they perform vile rituals, and burn their own flesh with Searing Collars."},
    [4940]={name="Veiled Grips",quality=1,ilvl=10,reqLevel=4,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Zalazane'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Master Gadrin in Durotar. Objective: Defeat Zalazane.Kill 8 Voodoo Trolls and 8 Hexed Trolls.Bring Zalazane's Head to Gadrin.",zone="Durotar",questName="Zalazane",lore="The witchdoctor Zalazane dwells on the Echo Isles to the east. They are the isles we once called home. From there he sends his trolls to the mainland, to hex our people and drag more of them under his sway."},
    [4942]={name="Tiger Hide Boots",quality=1,ilvl=12,reqLevel=4,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Dark Storms'. Starts with Orgnil Soulscar in Durotar. Objective: Bring Fizzle's Claw to Orgnil Soulscar in Razor Hill.",zone="Durotar",questName="Dark Storms",lore="We cannot allow the Burning Blade a foothold in Durotar! We must destroy them before their evil festers!"},
    [4944]={name="Handsewn Cloak",quality=1,ilvl=12,reqLevel=8,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Lost But Not Forgotten'. Starts with Misha Tor'kren in Durotar. Objective: Bring a sign of Kron's fate to Misha Tor'kren at the farmstead northwest of Razor Hill.",zone="Durotar",questName="Lost But Not Forgotten",lore="please, can you help me? My son Kron went hunting days ago, and he still hasn't returned. He went west towards the Barrens to hunt crocolisks along Southfury River."},
    [4946]={name="Lightweight Boots",quality=1,ilvl=10,reqLevel=4,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Zalazane'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Master Gadrin in Durotar. Objective: Defeat Zalazane.Kill 8 Voodoo Trolls and 8 Hexed Trolls.Bring Zalazane's Head to Gadrin.",zone="Durotar",questName="Zalazane",lore="The witchdoctor Zalazane dwells on the Echo Isles to the east. They are the isles we once called home. From there he sends his trolls to the mainland, to hex our people and drag more of them under his sway."},
    [4948]={name="Stinging Mace",quality=2,ilvl=11,reqLevel=4,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Skull Rock'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Margoz in Durotar. Objective: Gather Searing Collars from the cultists in Skull Rock.Bring them to Margoz at his camp.",zone="Durotar",questName="Skull Rock",lore=". The Burning Blade has infested the cave east of Orgrimmar known as Skull Rock. Inside that cave they perform vile rituals, and burn their own flesh with Searing Collars."},
    [4951]={name="Squealer's Belt",quality=1,ilvl=7,reqLevel=1,sourceType="world_drop",instructions="Drops from \"Squealer\" Thornmantle.",zone="Mulgore",npc="\"Squealer\" Thornmantle"},
    [4954]={name="Nomadic Belt",quality=1,ilvl=5,reqLevel=1,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Hunt Begins'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Grull Hawkwind in Mulgore. Objective: Grull Hawkwind in Camp Narache wants you to bring him 7 Plainstrider Feathers and 7 pieces of Plainstrider Meat.",zone="Red Cloud Mesa",questName="The Hunt Begins",lore="You have a promising air about you, and will prove yourself to the tribe. Perhaps someday soon you will be welcomed into the great city of Thunder Bluff."},
    [4958]={name="Sun-beaten Cloak",quality=1,ilvl=8,reqLevel=3,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Rite of Vision'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Zarlman Two-Moons in Mulgore. Objective: Consume the Water of the Seers in front of the tribal fire in Bloodhoof Village and follow the vision once it appears. Provided item:.",zone="Mulgore",questName="Rite of Vision",lore="I now present you with the Water of the Seers. When you are ready, consume the waters near the tribal fire. Once you have ingested the holy waters, it will take a few moments before the vision materializes before the fire."},
    [4962]={name="Double-layered Gloves",quality=1,ilvl=8,reqLevel=4,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Gathering Leather'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Veren Tallstrider in Thunder Bluff. Objective: Bring 12 pieces of Light Leather to Veren Tallstrider in Thunder Bluff.",zone="Thunder Bluff",questName="Gathering Leather",lore="Greetings, young one. You have a gleam in your eye; I can tell you are eager to venture back to the plains for the hunt. May you bring honor to your clan!"},
    [4967]={name="Tribal Warrior's Shield",quality=1,ilvl=11,reqLevel=7,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Preparation for Ceremony'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Eyahn Eagletalon in Thunder Bluff. Objective: Collect 6 Azure Feathers and 6 Bronze Feathers, and bring them to Eyahn Eagletalon in Thunder Bluff.",zone="Thunder Bluff",questName="Preparation for Ceremony",lore="my brother soon stands before Chief Bloodhoof, and it is my honor to make his headdress for him. I want to ask a favor of you while I finish tanning these leather straps."},
    [4969]={name="Fortified Bindings",quality=1,ilvl=10,reqLevel=6,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Dwarven Digging'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Baine Bloodhoof in Mulgore. Objective: Collect 5 Prospector's Picks.At a forge, smash the Prospector's Picks to create Broken Tools.Bring 5 Broken Tools to Baine Bloodhoof in Bloodhoof Village.",zone="Mulgore",questName="Dwarven Digging",lore="There are dwarves preparing a dig site to the northwest. They think secrets lie in the earth, and that is true, but hollowing and defiling the land is no way to earn its teachings."},
    [4971]={name="Skorn's Hammer",quality=2,ilvl=12,reqLevel=6,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Demon Scarred Cloak'. Pick it over the other reward choices. The quest is in Mulgore. Objective: Find someone who knows of Ghost Howl. Provided item:.",zone="Mulgore",questName="The Demon Scarred Cloak",lore="The ragged hide of Ghost Howl still bears a terrible wound, gained from the wolf's battles against the Burning Legion. Perhaps someone in Bloodhoof Village should know of Ghost Howl's demise...."},
    [4972]={name="Cliff Runner Boots",quality=1,ilvl=10,reqLevel=5,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Mazzranache'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Maur Raincaller in Mulgore. Objective: Bring a Prairie Wolf Heart, Flatland Cougar Femur, Plainstrider Scale and Swoop Gizzard to Maur Raincaller at Bloodhoof Village.",zone="Mulgore",questName="Mazzranache",lore="My grandfather told me stories about his battles with a strider named Mazzranache. He told me of its demonic red eyes, razor-sharp talons and venomous bite."},
    [5275]={name="Binding Girdle",quality=2,ilvl=15,reqLevel=9,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Disruption Ends'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Thork in The Barrens. Objective: Kill 8 Razormane Geomancers, 8 Razormane Defenders, and Kreenig Snarlsnout.Then bring Kreenig Snarlsnout's Tusk to Thork at the Crossroads.",zone="The Barrens",questName="The Disruption Ends",lore="One of my scouts witnessed an attack on a caravan from Durotar. The culprits are indeed the Razormane tribe of quilboars. One of the quilboars in particular is leading the raids: Kreenig Snarlsnout."},
    [5320]={name="Padded Lamellar Boots",quality=2,ilvl=16,reqLevel=9,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Stolen Booty'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Gazlowe in The Barrens. Objective: Retrieve the Shipment of Boots and Telescopic Lens for Gazlowe in Ratchet.",zone="The Barrens",questName="Stolen Booty",lore="While I'd like to recover all my goods, I'm sure that's not possible. Still, there's a few things that I absolutely must have! As you see, my observatory is ready to go, but it needs the smaller of the two lenses."},
    [5328]={name="Cinched Belt",quality=2,ilvl=15,reqLevel=9,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Disruption Ends'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Thork in The Barrens. Objective: Kill 8 Razormane Geomancers, 8 Razormane Defenders, and Kreenig Snarlsnout.Then bring Kreenig Snarlsnout's Tusk to Thork at the Crossroads.",zone="The Barrens",questName="The Disruption Ends",lore="One of my scouts witnessed an attack on a caravan from Durotar. The culprits are indeed the Razormane tribe of quilboars. One of the quilboars in particular is leading the raids: Kreenig Snarlsnout."},
    [5337]={name="Wayfaring Gloves",quality=2,ilvl=16,reqLevel=9,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Stolen Booty'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Gazlowe in The Barrens. Objective: Retrieve the Shipment of Boots and Telescopic Lens for Gazlowe in Ratchet.",zone="The Barrens",questName="Stolen Booty",lore="While I'd like to recover all my goods, I'm sure that's not possible. Still, there's a few things that I absolutely must have! As you see, my observatory is ready to go, but it needs the smaller of the two lenses."},
    [5341]={name="Spore-covered Tunic",quality=2,ilvl=15,reqLevel=9,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Root Samples'. Starts with Mebok Mizzyrix in The Barrens. Objective: Bring 8 Root Samples to Mebok Mizzyrix in Ratchet.",zone="The Barrens",questName="Root Samples",lore="The herbs of the Barrens are not quite like herbs in other lands. Their properties are mostly the same, but the oasis water here alters the plants; they are just slightly different."},
    [5344]={name="Pointed Axe",quality=2,ilvl=14,reqLevel=9,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Centaur Bracers'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Regthar Deathgate in The Barrens. Objective: Bring 15 Centaur Bracers to Regthar Deathgate, west of the Crossroads.",zone="The Barrens",questName="Centaur Bracers",lore="The Kolkar are a threat to the Horde's claims in the Barrens; we must reduce the numbers of their troops. And so, I have a bounty task for you."},
    [5345]={name="Stonewood Hammer",quality=2,ilvl=14,reqLevel=9,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Centaur Bracers'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Regthar Deathgate in The Barrens. Objective: Bring 15 Centaur Bracers to Regthar Deathgate, west of the Crossroads.",zone="The Barrens",questName="Centaur Bracers",lore="The Kolkar are a threat to the Horde's claims in the Barrens; we must reduce the numbers of their troops. And so, I have a bounty task for you."},
    [5394]={name="Archery Training Gloves",quality=1,ilvl=5,reqLevel=1,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Balance of Nature'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Conservator Ilthalaine in Teldrassil. Objective: Kill 7 Young Nightsabers and 4 Young Thistle Boars and return to Conservator Ilthalaine.",zone="Teldrassil",questName="The Balance of Nature",lore="Greetings. I am Conservator Ilthalaine. My purpose in Shadowglen is to ensure that the balance of nature is maintained."},
    [5395]={name="Woodland Shield",quality=1,ilvl=5,reqLevel=1,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Webwood Egg'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Gilshalan Windwalker in Teldrassil. Objective: Bring a Webwood Egg to Gilshalan in Aldrassil.",zone="Teldrassil",questName="Webwood Egg",lore="Now that I have the spiders' venom, I'd like some live specimens to study. Unfortunately, capturing a living, giant spider is more than I can ask of you, young."},
    [5398]={name="Canopy Leggings",quality=1,ilvl=5,reqLevel=1,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Woodland Protector'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Tarindrella in Teldrassil. Objective: Collect 8 Fel Moss and bring them to Tarindrella.",zone="Teldrassil",questName="The Woodland Protector",lore="Something evil is brewing in the forests of Teldrassil. Look long the hills to where the peaceful furbolgs used to dwell. They have deserted their homes and are amassing under the name of the Gnarlpine tribe."},
    [5399]={name="Tracking Boots",quality=1,ilvl=5,reqLevel=1,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Woodland Protector'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Tarindrella in Teldrassil. Objective: Collect 8 Fel Moss and bring them to Tarindrella.",zone="Teldrassil",questName="The Woodland Protector",lore="Something evil is brewing in the forests of Teldrassil. Look long the hills to where the peaceful furbolgs used to dwell. They have deserted their homes and are amassing under the name of the Gnarlpine tribe."},
    [5405]={name="Draped Cloak",quality=1,ilvl=5,reqLevel=1,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Balance of Nature'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Conservator Ilthalaine in Teldrassil. Objective: Kill 7 Young Nightsabers and 4 Young Thistle Boars and return to Conservator Ilthalaine.",zone="Teldrassil",questName="The Balance of Nature",lore="Thinning the younger population of creatures here in Shadowglen was a good start, but there is still work to be done. The resources of the forest will be depleted too quickly if the problem is not addressed."},
    [5419]={name="Feral Bracers",quality=1,ilvl=7,reqLevel=4,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Twisted Hatred'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Tallonkai Swiftroot in Teldrassil. Objective: Kill 8 Befouled Webwoods and bring Xethorr the Wicked's Mature Fel Moss to Tallonkai Swiftroot in Dolanaar.",zone="Teldrassil",questName="Twisted Hatred",lore="I must warn you, this matter must stay between us. The satyr are enough of an embarrassment to us already, and this one is much too close to home."},
    [5420]={name="Banshee Armor",quality=2,ilvl=14,reqLevel=9,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Demon Seed'. Starts with Ak'Zeloth in The Barrens. Objective: Grab a Flawed Power Stone. Bring it to the Altar of Fire before the stone expires, then return to Ak'Zeloth.",zone="Durotar",questName="The Demon Seed",lore="The Demon Seed is a powerful tool for the Burning Legion. It rests in a cave on Dreadmist Peak, above a demonic altar of fire. I have prepared power stones that when placed near the Seed will disrupt its connection to the Legion."},
    [5459]={name="Defender Axe",quality=2,ilvl=13,reqLevel=4,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Ursal the Mauler'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Athridas Bearmantle in Teldrassil. Objective: Kill Ursal the Mauler and return to Athridas Bearmantle in Dolanaar.",zone="Teldrassil",questName="Ursal the Mauler",lore="Now the time has come to save the Druids of the Talon. If we fail now, they will be forever lost in sleep. I shall prepare the Relics of Wakening and perform the ritual."},
    [5579]={name="Militia Warhammer",quality=1,ilvl=5,reqLevel=2,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Brotherhood of Thieves'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Deputy Willem in Elwynn Forest. Objective: Bring 12 Red Burlap Bandanas to Deputy Willem outside the Northshire Abbey.",zone="Elwynn Forest",questName="Brotherhood of Thieves",lore="Recently, a new group of thieves has been hanging around Northshire. They call themselves the Defias Brotherhood, and have been seen across the river to the east."},
    [5587]={name="Thornroot Club",quality=2,ilvl=13,reqLevel=4,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Ursal the Mauler'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Athridas Bearmantle in Teldrassil. Objective: Kill Ursal the Mauler and return to Athridas Bearmantle in Dolanaar.",zone="Teldrassil",questName="Ursal the Mauler",lore="Now the time has come to save the Druids of the Talon. If we fail now, they will be forever lost in sleep. I shall prepare the Relics of Wakening and perform the ritual."},
    [5589]={name="Moss-covered Gauntlets",quality=1,ilvl=10,reqLevel=4,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Oakenscowl'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Denalan in Teldrassil. Objective: Denalan at Lake Al'Ameth wants you to collect the Gargantuan Tumor from Oakenscowl.",zone="Teldrassil",questName="Oakenscowl",lore="In a cave along the southern bank of the lake, a timberling named Oakenscowl is spreading corruption to all the creatures that make Lake Al'Ameth their home."},
    [5591]={name="Rain-spotted Cape",quality=1,ilvl=11,reqLevel=6,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Enchanted Glade'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Sentinel Arynia Cloudsbreak in Teldrassil. Objective: Acquire 6 Bloodfeather Belts and bring them to Sentinel Arynia Cloudsbreak in the Oracle Glade.",zone="Teldrassil",questName="The Enchanted Glade",lore="I was dispatched with a small group of Sentinels here to protect the Oracle Tree from the harpies that have made nests all around the glade."},
    [5592]={name="Shackled Girdle",quality=1,ilvl=11,reqLevel=6,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Enchanted Glade'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Sentinel Arynia Cloudsbreak in Teldrassil. Objective: Acquire 6 Bloodfeather Belts and bring them to Sentinel Arynia Cloudsbreak in the Oracle Glade.",zone="Teldrassil",questName="The Enchanted Glade",lore="I was dispatched with a small group of Sentinels here to protect the Oracle Tree from the harpies that have made nests all around the glade."},
    [5593]={name="Crag Buckler",quality=1,ilvl=11,reqLevel=7,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Mist'. Pick it over the other reward choices. The quest is in Teldrassil. Objective: Escort Mist to Sentinel Arynia Cloudsbreak at the moon well near the Oracle Tree.",zone="Teldrassil",questName="Mist",lore="The sabercat's fur is a distinctive gray color, blending into the surrounding forest. As she lays there, you observe that she is badly wounded, with deep lacerations across her back and stomach."},
    [5595]={name="Thicket Hammer",quality=1,ilvl=11,reqLevel=1,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Crown of the Earth'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Corithras Moonrage in Darnassus. Objective: Bring the Filled Vessel to Arch Druid Fandral Staghelm in Darnassus.",zone="Teldrassil",questName="Crown of the Earth",lore="Without the blessings of Alexstrasza the Life-Binder and Nozdormu the Timeless, Teldrassil's growth has not been without flaw."},
    [5606]={name="Gardening Gloves",quality=1,ilvl=9,reqLevel=4,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Timberling Sprouts'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Denalan in Teldrassil. Objective: Bring 12 Timberling Sprouts to Denalan at Lake Al'Ameth.",zone="Teldrassil",questName="Timberling Sprouts",lore="Small timberlings are sprouting around the waters of Lake Al'Ameth. I'm afraid these sprouts are beyond help -- we should try to clear them from the land before they grow large enough to cause trouble."},
    [5617]={name="Vagabond Leggings",quality=2,ilvl=13,reqLevel=7,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Bashal'Aran'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Asterion in Darkshore. Objective: Destroy the Ancient Moonstone Seal at the ancient flame in Ameth'Aran, then return to Asterion in Bashal'Aran.",zone="Darkshore",questName="Bashal'Aran",lore="It was the craft of one of the most powerful of the Highborne that created the seal that formed my prison. In Ameth'Aran, the ruins to the south that are twin to these, persists even today an ancient flame, blue in color."},
    [5744]={name="Pale Skinner",quality=2,ilvl=14,reqLevel=9,sourceType="rare_npc",instructions="Drops from Fedfennel.",zone="Elwynn Forest",npc="Fedfennel"},
    [5777]={name="Brave's Axe",quality=1,ilvl=5,reqLevel=1,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Rite of Strength'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Seer Graytongue in Mulgore. Objective: Kill Bristlebacks in Brambleblade Ravine and bring 12 Bristleback Belts to Chief Hawkwind in Camp Narache.",zone="Red Cloud Mesa",questName="Rite of Strength",lore="The Rites of the Earthmother are the steps a young tauren needs to take to gain respect in Thunder Bluff. First you must pass the Rite of Strength."},
    [5779]={name="Forsaken Bastard Sword",quality=1,ilvl=5,reqLevel=2,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Scarlet Crusade'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Executor Arren in Tirisfal Glades. Objective: Bring Executor Arren 12 Scarlet Armbands from Scarlet Converts and Scarlet Initiates.",zone="Tirisfal Glades",questName="The Scarlet Crusade",lore="You'll be happy to know we appear to be making progress in the mine, thanks in no small part to your efforts. We can now turn our eyes to other concerns."},
    [5936]={name="Animal Skin Belt",quality=1,ilvl=8,reqLevel=4,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Gathering Leather'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Veren Tallstrider in Thunder Bluff. Objective: Bring 12 pieces of Light Leather to Veren Tallstrider in Thunder Bluff.",zone="Thunder Bluff",questName="Gathering Leather",lore="Greetings, young one. You have a gleam in your eye; I can tell you are eager to venture back to the plains for the hunt. May you bring honor to your clan!"},
    [5940]={name="Bone Buckler",quality=1,ilvl=12,reqLevel=5,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Prodigal Lich Returns'. Starts with Gunther Arcanus in Undercity. Objective: Bring the Nether Gem to Bethor Iceshard in the Undercity.",zone="Tirisfal Glades",questName="The Prodigal Lich Returns",lore="Take this Nether Gem to my old comrade Bethor. It will let us communicate... and I have much to tell him."},
    [5941]={name="Brass Scale Pants",quality=1,ilvl=11,reqLevel=6,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Wanted: Maggot Eye'. Pick it over the other reward choices. The quest is in Tirisfal Glades. Objective: Kill Maggot Eye and return to Executor Zygand in Brill with his paw for a reward.",zone="Tirisfal Glades",questName="Wanted: Maggot Eye",lore="Wanted: Maggot Eye! A foul beast, even by Gnoll standards, Maggot Eye has been sentenced to death for his crimes against The Forsaken. This despicable villain has been stealing corpses for use by the Lich King's army."},
    [5957]={name="Handstitched Leather Vest",quality=2,ilvl=10,reqLevel=3,sourceType="profession",instructions="Crafted with Leatherworking (requires skill 1).",profession="Leatherworking"},
    [6058]={name="Blackened Leather Belt",quality=1,ilvl=5,reqLevel=1,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Balance of Nature'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Conservator Ilthalaine in Teldrassil. Objective: Kill 7 Young Nightsabers and 4 Young Thistle Boars and return to Conservator Ilthalaine.",zone="Teldrassil",questName="The Balance of Nature",lore="Thinning the younger population of creatures here in Shadowglen was a good start, but there is still work to be done. The resources of the forest will be depleted too quickly if the problem is not addressed."},
    [6059]={name="Nomadic Vest",quality=1,ilvl=5,reqLevel=1,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Battleboars'. Starts with Grull Hawkwind in Mulgore. Objective: Grull Hawkwind in Camp Narache wants you to kill Battleboars and bring back 8 Battleboar Snouts and 8 Battleboar Flanks.",zone="Red Cloud Mesa",questName="The Battleboars",lore="The Battleboars of Brambleblade Ravine to the east are encroaching on our tribal hunting grounds. They are trained to be malicious by the Bristleback Quilboars with whom we are at war."},
    [6060]={name="Flax Bracers",quality=1,ilvl=5,reqLevel=2,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Damned'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Novice Elreth in Tirisfal Glades. Objective: Novice Elreth requires 6 Scavenger Paws and 6 Duskbat Wings.",zone="Tirisfal Glades",questName="The Damned",lore="My duties include tending to our wounded warriors, tailoring armor and clothes, and assisting Shadow Priest Sarvis with whatever else he might need."},
    [6061]={name="Graystone Bracers",quality=1,ilvl=8,reqLevel=4,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Timberling Sprouts'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Denalan in Teldrassil. Objective: Bring 12 Timberling Sprouts to Denalan at Lake Al'Ameth.",zone="Teldrassil",questName="Timberling Sprouts",lore="Small timberlings are sprouting around the waters of Lake Al'Ameth. I'm afraid these sprouts are beyond help -- we should try to clear them from the land before they grow large enough to cause trouble."},
    [6063]={name="Cold Steel Gauntlets",quality=1,ilvl=8,reqLevel=4,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Graverobbers'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Magistrate Sevren in Tirisfal Glades. Objective: Kill Rot Hide Graverobbers and Rot Hide Mongrels. Bring 8 Embalming Ichors to Magistrate Sevren in Brill.",zone="Tirisfal Glades",questName="Graverobbers",lore="The Mass Graves, southwest of Garren's Haunt to the north, were made to accommodate the...impressive...number of deaths Tirisfal suffered when the Plague first came."},
    [6070]={name="Wolfskin Bracers",quality=1,ilvl=5,reqLevel=1,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Wolves Across the Border'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Eagan Peltskinner in Elwynn Forest. Objective: Bring 8 pieces of Tough Wolf Meat to Eagan Peltskinner outside Northshire Abbey.",zone="Elwynn Forest",questName="Wolves Across the Border",lore="I hate those nasty timber wolves! But I sure like eating wolf steaks... Bring me tough wolf meat and I will exchange it for something you'll find useful."},
    [6076]={name="Tapered Pants",quality=1,ilvl=5,reqLevel=2,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Bounty on Garrick Padfoot'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Deputy Willem in Elwynn Forest. Objective: Kill Garrick Padfoot and bring his head to Deputy Willem at Northshire Abbey.",zone="Elwynn Forest",questName="Bounty on Garrick Padfoot",lore="Garrick Padfoot - a cutthroat who's plagued our farmers and merchants for weeks - was seen at a shack near the vineyards, which lies east of the Abbey and across the bridge."},
    [6078]={name="Pikeman Shield",quality=1,ilvl=5,reqLevel=1,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Report to Goldshire'. Starts with Marshal McBride in Elwynn Forest. Objective: Take Marshal McBride's Documents to Marshal Dughan in Goldshire.",zone="Elwynn Forest",questName="Report to Goldshire",lore="you are a with proven interest in the security of Northshire. You are now tasked with the protection of the surrounding Elwynn Forest."},
    [6084]={name="Stormwind Guard Leggings",quality=2,ilvl=13,reqLevel=5,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Wanted: \"Hogger\"'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="Elwynn Forest",questName="Wanted:  \"Hogger\"",lore="He has overpowered all attempts at his capture. The Stormwind Army has placed a generous bounty on the Gnoll."},
    [6085]={name="Footman Tunic",quality=2,ilvl=13,reqLevel=5,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Wanted: \"Hogger\"'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="Elwynn Forest",questName="Wanted:  \"Hogger\"",lore="Wanted: Hogger A huge gnoll, Hogger, is prowling the woods in southwestern Elwynn. He has overpowered all attempts at his capture. The Stormwind Army has placed a generous bounty on the Gnoll."},
    [6147]={name="Ratty Old Belt",quality=2,ilvl=12,reqLevel=7,sourceType="rare_npc",instructions="Drops from Narg the Taskmaster.",zone="Elwynn Forest",npc="Narg the Taskmaster"},
    [6148]={name="Web-covered Boots",quality=1,ilvl=10,reqLevel=5,sourceType="rare_npc",instructions="Drops from Mother Fang.",zone="Elwynn Forest",npc="Mother Fang"},
    [6171]={name="Wolf Handler Gloves",quality=1,ilvl=5,reqLevel=1,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Dwarven Outfitters'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Sten Stoutarm in Dun Morogh. Objective: Sten Stoutarm would like 8 pieces of Tough Wolf Meat.",zone="Dun Morogh",questName="Dwarven Outfitters",lore="You look as though you might need something to keep your hands warm, hm? I'll tell you what would help: a pair of nice, warm gloves."},
    [6173]={name="Snow Boots",quality=1,ilvl=5,reqLevel=1,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'A New Threat'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Balir Frosthammer in Dun Morogh. Objective: Balir Frosthammer wants you to kill 6 Rockjaw Troggs and 6 Burly Rockjaw Troggs.",zone="Dun Morogh",questName="A New Threat",lore="I hope you're here to lend us a hand. After the last trogg attack, we could use all the help we can get. I hear the buggers have been popping up all across the lands, and it seems Coldridge Valley is no exception."},
    [6176]={name="Dwarven Kite Shield",quality=1,ilvl=5,reqLevel=1,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Stolen Journal'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Grelin Whitebeard in Dun Morogh. Objective: Grelin Whitebeard wants you to kill Grik'nir the Cold, and retrieve his journal.",zone="Dun Morogh",questName="The Stolen Journal",lore="My journal! They took it away to the cave. The one that had it... It was a big brute with some odd markings on his skin and face. I didn't get a much better look than that."},
    [6177]={name="Ironwrought Bracers",quality=1,ilvl=12,reqLevel=7,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Tundra MacGrann's Stolen Stash'. Pick it over the other reward choices. The quest is in Dun Morogh. Objective: Retrieve Tundra MacGrann's dried meats from the stolen meat locker in Old Icebeard's cave.",zone="Dun Morogh",questName="Tundra MacGrann's Stolen Stash",lore="I had a month's worth of dried meats salted and locked away for the cold season. Kept it locked so the bears wouldn't get it! But while I was off hunting deer, that beast, Old Icebeard, made off with the meat locker."},
    [6185]={name="Bear Shawl",quality=1,ilvl=5,reqLevel=1,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'A New Threat'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Balir Frosthammer in Dun Morogh. Objective: Balir Frosthammer wants you to kill 6 Rockjaw Troggs and 6 Burly Rockjaw Troggs.",zone="Dun Morogh",questName="A New Threat",lore="I hope you're here to lend us a hand. After the last trogg attack, we could use all the help we can get. I hear the buggers have been popping up all across the lands, and it seems Coldridge Valley is no exception."},
